%!PS-Adobe-3.0
% grand_canyon_dem.ps -- the first real-terrain view (#156): the Copernicus
% grid (data/terrain/grand_canyon, #155) as the ground, from near Mather
% Point on the South Rim looking north across the canyon. Materials are
% still the mountains' (strata are #160); this checks the geometry.
%   scripts/render.sh spikes/grand_canyon_dem.ps
/DemOn true def
(data/terrain/grand_canyon.ps) run
/Erode where { pop } { /Erode false def } ifelse
/StandLL where { pop } { /StandLL [ 36.0617 -112.1078 ] def } ifelse     % Mather Point, on the rim
/LookLL where { pop } { /LookLL [ 36.1250 -112.0700 ] def } ifelse       % across the canyon, north-north-east
/LookTilt where { pop } { /LookTilt -9 def } ifelse
/CamAbove where { pop } { /CamAbove 1.5 def } ifelse
/HFov where { pop } { /HFov 60 def } ifelse
/TMax where { pop } { /TMax 2600 def } ifelse
/HazeDist where { pop } { /HazeDist 2500 def } ifelse
/HazeH where { pop } { /HazeH 120 def } ifelse
/SnowLine where { pop } { /SnowLine 1000 def } ifelse
/TreeLine where { pop } { /TreeLine -1000 def } ifelse
/CloudLo where { pop } { /CloudLo 330 def } ifelse
/CloudHi where { pop } { /CloudHi 370 def } ifelse
/Threshold where { pop } { /Threshold 0.64 def } ifelse
/CoverAmp where { pop } { /CoverAmp 0.4 def } ifelse
/SunElev where { pop } { /SunElev 35 def } ifelse
/SunAzim where { pop } { /SunAzim -60 def } ifelse
(lib/fc_landscape.ps) run
/Res where { pop } { /Res 1 def } ifelse
320 200 fc-landscape
showpage
